# The bit-identity corpus.
#
# One deck per line:   <path relative to repo root>  <TAB>  <why it is here>
# Blank lines and #-comments ignored.  Basenames must be unique --
# run_corpus.sh refuses a duplicate, because every deck writes its .out
# under its own basename.
#
# Read tests/parity/README.md before adding a deck.  In particular: a deck
# earns its place by reaching a code path no other deck reaches, and the
# reason column is where you say which.

# ---- FV routing (10) ------------------------------------------------------
